        <activityName xml:lang="en">Printed wiring board, power supply unit desktop PC, solder mix, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Printed wiring board, power supply unit desktop PC, solder mix, at plant
After 2023, only Pb-free solder technologies are assumed here.; UUID: 2ab60468-7f67-3080-957a-13628226eb33
This dataset represents a mix of Pb-containing and Pb-free soldered PWBs used in the power supply unit (PSU) of a Desktop PC. In includes only these two distinguished soldering processes as input.
Location: Own estimation - used for the global average
Technology: average PWB mounting technology (wave soldering)
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: own estimation
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2ab60468-7f67-3080-957a-13628226eb33.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
